udit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py and count.py only parse a pasted board and report group liberties and an area count of the current position, and the other commands just cat/tail notes and append to games.md and CLAUDE.md. Nothing chooses, ranks or looks ahead at moves.", "stop": false}}